只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Odoo SDD - Plugin DeepSeek Harness (DSH)","id":"gh:1361919452","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-odoo-sdd","slug":"fhidalgodev/dsh-odoo-sdd","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins","dsh-skill","odoo","sdd","spec-driven-development"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Odoo SDD - Plugin DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Spec-Driven Development for Odoo"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Turn DeepSeek Harness into a closed-loop Odoo workshop:\nspec → architecture → code → verify, against"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"rness into a closed-loop Odoo workshop:\nspec → architecture → code → verify, against a real instance"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🇬🇧 English  •\n🇪🇸 Español  •\n🇨🇳 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Author: Franyer Hidalgo — fhidalgo.dev@gmail.com"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"⭐ If this plugin saves you time, a star helps a lot — it is the signal that keeps the pipeline maint"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"his plugin saves you time, a star helps a lot — it is the signal that keeps the pipeline maintained."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"🐛 Found a bug or want a feature? Open an issue in any language. Reproducible reports and honest \"thi"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"s did not work\" notes are the most useful thing you can send."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Need | Why |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| **DSH ≥ 0.2.2-rc.1** on **Node ≥ 20** | the plugin mounts as a Cordis bundle and uses the `tools` "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"service; that host declares **Node ≥ 24.9.0** itself, so Node 24 is the practical floor for running "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"it (the plugin's own code runs on 20) |\n| An **existing Odoo instance** reachable over HTTP(S) | the"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" loop needs a real server to install into and read tracebacks from |\n| A **disposable dev/staging da"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"tabase** | verification installs modules and writes test data |\n| *(optional)* a **Playwright** brow"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"ser tool | only for the UI layer of verification and for narrated-manual captures; without it those "},{"id":"p10s7","text":"scenarios are marked for manual checking |\n| *(optional)* `playwright-core` **1.63.0** (pinned) | sh"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"ips with the plugin as an optional dependency; the capture motor drives Chromium, Chrome or Edge, an"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"d answers `NEEDS_BROWSER` with the one-line remedy when none is present |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 🔐 Security & network posture"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **No phone-home.** The plugin's ONLY outbound network calls go to the instance\nURL you put in `.en"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"v`. No telemetry, no update checks, no third-party\nendpoints.\n- **Transport guard (fail-closed).** `"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"http://` is accepted only for loopback\nhosts (`localhost`, `127.x`, `::1`, `*.localhost`); anything "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"else must be\n`https://`, otherwise credential loading is refused — plain http to a remote\nhost would"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" ship the API key in clear text.\n- **Secret containment.** The secret is read once by `credentials.t"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"s` and only\ninjected into RPC parameters. Every tool output passes through two-layer\nredaction (know"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"n secret + generic `password=` / `Bearer` / `api_key=` /\n`session_id` shapes) and home-path masking "},{"id":"p12s8","text":"(`/home/user/…` → `~/…`) before\nbeing shown to the model or persisted to the KB.\n- **Session cookies"},{"id":"p12s9","text":" never reach the model.** `odoo_session` writes the cookie to\n`.sdd/session.json` (chmod 600) and re"},{"id":"p12s10","text":"turns only the path. The capture motor\ndoes not even write one: it authenticates the web session in "},{"id":"p12s11","text":"memory and keeps\nthe cookie there for the browser context.\n- **The capture browser is locked to the "},{"id":"p12s12","text":"instance origin.** Every request that\nleaves the instance's base URL is aborted, so a page that trie"},{"id":"p12s13","text":"s to reach a\nthird-party host fails instead of loading. Capture is read-only by default:\nsteps that "},{"id":"p12s14","text":"only observe (`goto`, `menu`, `wait`, `assert`, `explore`,\n`screenshot`, `confirm`) always run; step"},{"id":"p12s15","text":"s that act (`new`, `fill`, `select`,\n`press`, `click`) require `allow_actions=true` AND `confirm_des"},{"id":"p12s16","text":"tructive=true`,\nthe guard classifies that call as a mutation (spec in a writing phase or a\nwaiver) —"},{"id":"p12s17","text":" and **a click has no compensating entry**: unlike a CRUD call, the\nplugin cannot undo what the UI d"},{"id":"p12s18","text":"id. Capture against a disposable database.\n- **A recording is read as data, and credentials are refu"},{"id":"p12s19","text":"sed.** `odoo_manual\noperation=import` parses the `codegen` text; a recording carrying a password\nfie"},{"id":"p12s20","text":"ld, an `Authorization` header or a cookie is rejected by line, and the\nvalue is never echoed back.\n-"},{"id":"p12s21","text":" **A credential file is not written while git can still see it (fail-closed).**\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## ⚠️ Known limitations and deferred work"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Remote tests** — without shell access to the instance there is no way to run\n`--test-enable`; th"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"e second verification layer is RPC/UI testing. Pending: an\noptional `odoo_run_tests` tool if you exp"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ose a test runner.\n- **Data rollback is best effort** — the tests write to the connected database an"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"d\nthere is no ephemeral cloning (by design: you provision and own the target).\n`sdd_checkpoint` reve"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"rses data written through `odoo_execute`, but a module\ninstall/upgrade is **not** reverted at databa"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"se level. Use a disposable\ndatabase.\n- **Static security scan scope** — `odoo_security_scan` is rule"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"-based over source\ntext (no AST, no taint tracking), so it catches the common Odoo mistakes, not\neve"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"rything; it complements a human review, never replaces it.\n- **The change policy covers tool calls, "},{"id":"p14s9","text":"not the shell** — `write`/`edit` and the\nOdoo tools are gated; a file written through `bash` (heredo"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"c, `sed -i`) is not,\nbecause the host exposes no after-the-fact inspection of what a shell command\nw"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"rote. The policy makes the pipeline the path of least resistance and the\nexception visible; it is no"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"t a sandbox.\n- **Multi-instance** — one target per project (`.env`). Pending: named instance\nprofile"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"s (`dev`, `staging`).\n- **Panel fields that are informational** — `autonomy` and\n`securityInterviewR"},{"id":"p14s14","text":"equired` are stored and reported, but the pipeline reads the\ndelegation decision from `.sdd/setup-st"},{"id":"p14s15","text":"ate.json` (set with `odoo_setup\nmode=autonomy`) and enforces the security interview through the ARCH"},{"id":"p14s16","text":"ITECTURE\ncontent gate. Tracked as pending work.\n- **Manual capture needs a browser and a password** "},{"id":"p14s17","text":"— `playwright-core` is an\noptional dependency and the browser itself is not shipped: without Chromiu"},{"id":"p14s18","text":"m,\nChrome or Edge the capture answers `NEEDS_BROWSER` with the install line. A\nweb session also need"},{"id":"p14s19","text":"s the account **password** (Odoo refuses an API key on\ninteractive logins), so an API-key-only proje"},{"id":"p14s20","text":"ct can still write and lint a\nmanual but cannot drive the screenshots automatically.\n- **The manual "},{"id":"p14s21","text":"covers one model at a time** — the canon is read per model, so a\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Security decisions"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- The secret only exists inside `credentials.ts` and the RPC call parameters;\nevery output passes th"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"rough `redact()` (including `user:pass@` URL shapes).\n- The transport guard rejects anything that is"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" neither HTTPS nor loopback before\nauthenticating.\n- Mutations are fail-closed twice over: the allow"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"list is read live on every call,\nand the policy guard denies `create`/`write`/`unlink` unless a chec"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"kpoint\nexists and the spec is in `WRITE_CODE` or later.\n- Secrets are never accepted as tool paramet"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ers, never written to the audit log,\nand never requested through chat.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
